  "recordSet": [],
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "rbo_oxe_base_language_table_lerobot",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tLanguage Table (LeRobot) \u2014 Task-Pruned, Reindexed Subset\n\t\n\nThis release is a task-pruned subset of the original\nIPEC-COMMUNITY/language_table_lerobot.\nWe subsampled by task text and rebuilt the package so it remains internally consistent\n(indices, splits, stats, paths).\n\nRobot: xArm  \nModality: RGB video + states + actions  \nFPS / Resolution: 10 FPS, 360\u00d7640, AV1  \nLicense: apache-2.0 (inherits from source)\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tWhat\u2019s different in this subset\n\t\n\n\nKept ~0.85% of unique tasks\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/saaduddinM/rbo_oxe_base_language_table_lerobot.",
  "alternateName": [
    "saaduddinM/rbo_oxe_base_language_table_lerobot"
  ],
